# ============================================================================
#  YOUR DOCUMENTS AND INDEXES — never commit these
# ============================================================================
# The library: one folder per dataset, each holding a SQLite index built from
# your own documents. The index stores the full text of everything you indexed,
# so publishing one publishes the documents themselves.
#
# Nothing here needs to be in the repository: the app creates the folder on
# first run, and every index can be rebuilt by re-indexing.
DataSets/

# Belt and braces, in case DataSetsRoot is pointed somewhere else inside the
# repo, or an index is left at the old default location.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
dataset.json

# Transcripts saved from the Ask panel — they contain your questions and
# passages quoted out of your documents.
rag-*.txt

# ============================================================================
#  Local and personal files
# ============================================================================
# Personal notes and question lists that tend to accumulate next to the code.
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pdf

# Claude Code's per-machine settings.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Anything explicitly marked local, plus the usual secret-bearing filenames.
# (This project has no secrets today — it only talks to a local Ollama with no
# authentication — but these cost nothing and prevent a future mistake.)
appsettings.*.local.json
*.local.json
.env
.env.*
secrets.json

# ============================================================================
#  Build output and IDE state
# ============================================================================
bin/
obj/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
TestResults/
